{
  "id": "16-dry-run-diff-for-a-candidate-module",
  "description": "REQ CAP-030..033. An uninstalled module is materialised, loaded through the ordinary loader and replayed over two recorded flows: one it changes, one it does not match. The golden pins the unified body diff, the header ops and the aggregate tallies \u2014 the three things a dry run is read for.",
